    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Second International Conference on Early Childhood Development, an initiative by the Aga Khan University's Institute for Human Development (IHD), in partnership with The Hilton Foundation and The Aga Khan Foundation, will for the first time come to Dar Es Salaam, Tanzania. The conference will be held at the Dar Es Salaam Serena Hotel from November 7th to 9th 2017 and will present a rare opportunity for active engagement among leading researchers, programme implementers, educationalists and policy makers involved in early childhood development in the low and middle income regions of the world.",
